AppErrorNotify
==============

Modified version of AppErrorsTracking <https://github.com/KitsunePie/AppErrorsTracking>.
This is an unofficial fork; the upstream author does not maintain or endorse it.

Copyright (C) 2017 Fankes Studio (qzmmcn@163.com)
Copyright (C) 2026 Vstory (Java rework)

Modifications carried out since 2026:

- Rewritten in pure Java against libxposed API 102 (upstream is Kotlin + YukiHookAPI).
- Application id changed to io.github.vstory.apperrors and display name to AppErrorNotify.
- Crash display switched from the system error dialog to a system notification, with
  per-app display modes, mute rules and a crash-storm breaker added.
- Upstream AppCenter analytics upload removed.

